  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> A tactician can improve one friendly ally's failed attack with 1d4 per round. This demonstrates the per-round count behavior without spending a reaction or spell slot.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
